  "open_questions": [
    "TDS DL2-14874.pdf ('TDS OF RF6602') undated; SDS RF6602.pdf issue/revision 18/2/2022.",
    "Physical properties (no field in the component templates): TDS DL2-14874.pdf p.1 (Index / Typical, method): Kinematic Viscosity (100℃) 1100-1850 / 1360 mm2/s ASTM D445; Flash Point (COC) ≮180 / 210 ℃ ASTM D92; Density (20℃) 850-950 / 919 kg/m3 ASTM D4052; Color ＜0.5 ASTM D1500. SDS RF6602.pdf Section 9: Flash point 160 °C; Viscosity, kinematic 53691mm²/s (40℃); Density 0.9 g/cm³ (no temperature).",
    "Flash point differs: TDS index '≮180' / typical 210 ℃ (COC) vs SDS 'Flash point : 160 °C' (no method). No template field; recorded here, not resolved.",
    "Density: TDS 919 kg/m3 (20℃) vs SDS 0.9 g/cm³ - same value rounded to one decimal, not a conflict.",
    "Thickening table (TDS p.1): reference oils 150N, 500N, Group Ⅲ 6# at 0/1/3/5 % treat; ΔKV100 values are Calculated (difference from the 0 % row). No test method printed -> 'usable' false.",
    "Shear test 'The Shear of Diesel Injector Nozzle' (30 and 250 cycles) in 150N at 6 % and 10 %: no standard (e.g. ASTM D6278/D7109) and no SSI printed; percentage KV100 loss calculated. Units for KV100 not printed in that table.",
    "Polymer form (solid/concentrate) not stated; appearance 'Clear、bright、no sediment viscous liquid'. Treat range by SAE grade, HTHS, CCS/MRV impact, gelation and dissolution temperature not printed.",
    "Storage (TDS p.1): short-term storage/transport ≤ 75℃, long-term ≤ 45℃ (not a dissolution/blend temperature).",
    "Old Product_JSON uses record id 'RF6602' (no RICHFUL_ prefix); kept per decision (d)."
